// expect: refuse E_DeclaredRowContradiction
// The decl-site row contradiction (band L's
// Hβ.diag.declared-row-contradiction): `with E + !E` asserts one name
// present AND absent — unsatisfiable as written, and the pre-diagnostic
// meet resolved it by silently dropping the negation (the performing
// body checked CLEAN under a declared !E). Both decls refuse at the
// clause, pure body and performing body alike.
effect E {
  op() -> Int
}
fn contradicts() with E + !E = 1
fn quiet_contradicts() with E + !E = op()
fn main() = 0
